## This is the list of cheats that are accessible via curl operations.dev/<name>

operations.dev/awscli                         - Sample AWS cli IAM call note the port is needed
operations.dev/cce                            - Cloudian CCE class lab notes
operations.dev/cfirewall                      - These are my hints for customizing cloudian firewall
operations.dev/claude                         - Claude Code + shared knowledge: start here
operations.dev/config                         - Hyperstore commands to get an idea of the config
operations.dev/custom                         - Customization hints below
operations.dev/doppler                        - Doppler secrets - install, auth, and running things with them
operations.dev/git                            - github command line notes
operations.dev/hist                           - Estate shell history: never lose bash history again
operations.dev/hsctl                          - HSCTL quick reference
operations.dev/hsh                            - Get hsh status
operations.dev/iam_sourceip_example_cloudian  - IAM policy to only allow put object from 192.168.0.90
operations.dev/ip                             - What is my IP - WAN, LAN, and which network am I on
operations.dev/license                        - Cloudian license stuff
operations.dev/logs                           - Kinda general hints for logs
operations.dev/obsidian                       - Obsidian cheat sheet
operations.dev/osmigrate                      - Cloudian Centos to Rocky README
operations.dev/packer                         - Command to run packer
operations.dev/powerscale                     - Dell Powerscale OneFS
operations.dev/powershell                     - Fix this stupid windows ssh Corrupted MAC on input
operations.dev/repair                         - Hyperstore repair notes
operations.dev/upgrade                        - Disables most auto repair things
operations.dev/vmware                         - Upgrade vcenter on cli
